  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/c819af62-1564-4f83-8e67-787fb68f60b7-image.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 81px;\" /></p><p>When a dielectric is inserted between the sheets of a capacitor, its capacitance becomes&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>K</mi><mi>C</mi></math>.</p><p>Now the equivalent capacitance in series combination will be,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>eq</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>K</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>C</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>K</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>24</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>40</mn><mi>K</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>K</mi></mrow></mfrac><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>K</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p></blockquote>",
